  "description": "Club de Nuit White Imperiale is a luxurious floral vanilla fragrance that blends bright fruits, elegant white florals, and creamy musky sweetness into a refined feminine scent. The fragrance feels sophisticated, romantic, and smooth with a soft niche-inspired elegance. The opening introduces lychee, bergamot, and nutmeg, creating a fruity fresh sweetness balanced by a subtle warm spice. The heart develops into Turkish rose, vanilla, peony, and musk, adding creamy floral richness with a soft romantic character and elegant depth. The base settles into vanilla, cashmeran, cedarwood, and incense, leaving a warm, powdery, and long-lasting trail that feels luxurious, feminine, and addictive. White Imperiale is perfect for women who enjoy elegant floral vanilla fragrances with creamy musky warmth and a refined niche-style profile.",
